1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Yacine always said: My mother disappeared when I was little.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Mother, can I help you cross the road?

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:19,000
God bless you, my son.
No problem, mother.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:27,000
He held her hand, not knowing that moment would change his life.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:34,000
When he helped her across, an old bracelet fell.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:42,000
This bracelet... where did you get it?

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:50,000
I had a little son named Yacine...
I lost him in the market twenty years ago.

8
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Mother... you used to tell me:
Don’t cry, my light.

9
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Yacine? My son?
Mother...
After twenty years, the hug he had been missing finally returned.
